  "mechanisms": [
    {
      "id": "mechanism_1",
      "name": "solute segregation at stacking faults",
      "category": "segregation",
      "sample_id": null,
      "material_state": null,
      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "14",
          "section": null,
          "quote": "在高温蠕变过程中，前者层错处偏聚的合金元素主要以 W 为主[91,110]；后者则多以 Co 和 Cr 为主[28,94]，与镍基合金中温高应力的情况较为类似[105]。",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "3e5420338d675850:part:002"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanism_2",
      "name": "segregation-assisted phase transformation",
      "category": "phase transformation",
      "sample_id": null,
      "material_state": null,
      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "14",
          "section": null,
          "quote": "Lu 等[91,104]和Lenz 等[94]研究发现，层错交截和层错领先不全位错处 γ 相形成元素的富集均会诱导局部的 γ'相向 γ 相 (γ'→ γ) 转变，如图 14[94,104]所示。",
          "table": null,
          "figure": "14",
          "chunk_id": "3e5420338d675850:part:002"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanism_3",
      "name": "anti-phase boundary energy increase by W, Ta, Nb segregation",
      "category": "strengthening",
      "sample_id": null,
      "material_state": null,
      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "14",
          "section": null,
          "quote": "χ/η 相形成元素 (W、Ta、Nb 等) 的偏聚会明显提高反相畴界能，从而抑制拖尾不全位错切入 γ'相，提高蠕变抗力；而 Co 和 Cr 等元素的偏析对反相畴界能的影响不如 W 等元素明显。",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "3e5420338d675850:part:002"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanism_4",
      "name": "stacking fault strengthening",
      "category": "strengthening",
      "sample_id": null,
      "material_state": null,
      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "15",
          "section": null,
          "quote": "揭示了正错配度、低层错能的钴基高温合金高温蠕变变形和层错强化机理，为该类合金的进一步优化提供了理论基础。",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "3e5420338d675850:part:002"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanism_5",
      "name": "segregation-assisted rafting",
      "category": "microstructural evolution",
      "sample_id": null,
      "material_state": null,
      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "14",
          "section": null,
          "quote": "He 等[113]研究发现，当领先不全位错运动至 γ/γ'相界面时，也会携带部分 γ'相形成元素至 γ 相，诱导局部 γ'相形核，使 γ'相沿层错面方向粗化连接，最终形成平行于 {111}面的筏排组织，从而影响筏排组织的完整性，降低蠕变性能。",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "3e5420338d675850:part:002"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanism_6",
      "name": "Cottrell atmosphere effect on stacking fault extension",
      "category": "dislocation interaction",
      "sample_id": null,
      "material_state": null,
      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "14",
          "section": null,
          "quote": "Lu 等[91]研究认为，对比合金元素在层错上的扩散，层错领先不全位错处的 Cottrell 气团对层错扩展的影响更为重要。",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "3e5420338d675850:part:002"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanism_7",
      "name": "diffusion of alloying elements along stacking faults",
      "category": "diffusion",
      "sample_id": null,
      "material_state": null,
      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "14",
          "section": null,
          "quote": "Makineni 等[112]认为合金元素沿层错方向上的扩散是影响其在 γ'相中扩展的关键因素。",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "3e5420338d675850:part:002"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanism_8",
      "name": "defect type transformation induced by segregation",
      "category": "phase transformation",
      "sample_id": null,
      "material_state": null,
      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": "14",
          "section": null,
          "quote": "Barba 等[111]提出，CISF 和复杂外禀层错 (complex extrinsic stacking fault，CESF) 处的合金元素偏析会诱导 2 种结构附近的原子发生重新排列 (有序化)，进而发生 CISF→SISF 和 CESF→SESF 转变，如图 13a[111]所示。",
          "table": null,
          "figure": "13a",
          "chunk_id": "3e5420338d675850:part:002"
        }
      ]
    }
